3:39","t":"And never will it benefit you that Day, when you have wronged, that you are [all] sharing in the punishment.","j":25,"h":50,"s":43,"a":39,"sd":null},{"k":"43:40","t":"Then will you make the deaf hear, [O Muḥammad], or guide the blind or he who is in clear error?","j":25,"h":50,"s":43,"a":40,"sd":null},{"k":"43:41","t":"And whether [or not] We take you away [in death], indeed, We will take retribution upon them.","j":25,"h":50,"s":43,"a":41,"sd":null},{"k":"43:42","t":"Or whether [or not] We show you that which We have promised them, indeed, We are Perfect in Ability.","j":25,"h":50,"s":43,"a":42,"sd":null},{"k":"43:43","t":"So adhere to that which is revealed to you. Indeed, you are on a straight path.","j":25,"h":50,"s":43,"a":43,"sd":null},{"k":"43:44","t":"And indeed, it is a remembrance for you and your people, and you [all] are going to be questioned.","j":25,"h":50,"s":43,"a":44,"sd":null},{"k":"43:45","t":"And ask those We sent before you of Our messengers; have We made besides the Most Merciful deities to be worshipped?","j":25,"h":50,"s":43,"a":45,"sd":null},{"k":"43:46","t":"And certainly did We send Moses with Our signs to Pharaoh and his establishment, and he said, \"Indeed, I am the messenger of the Lord of the worlds.\"","j":25,"h":50,"s":43,"a":46,"sd":null},{"k":"43:47","t":"But when he brought them Our signs, at once they laughed at them.","j":25,"h":50,"s":43,"a":47,"sd":null}],"juz":25,"hizb":50,"surahs":[43],"sajdah":false}